# Commander's isolated Claude config home.
# The spawned claude writes runtime state here (login/account in .claude.json,
# sessions, projects, caches). That state is per-machine and may carry account
# identifiers / secrets — it MUST stay local and never be committed.
# Strategy: ignore everything, then allow-list only the committed config files.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/settings.json
!/rules/
!/lessons/
